OL,3,GNEWSA'If it wasn't for my dad I
OL,4,Awouldn't be a footballer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe had started playing football with
OL,7,Fher family before joining Bradwell
OL,8,FBelles aged nine, later progressing
OL,9,Fthrough Stoke City's academy and
OL,10,Fjoining Wolves.
OL,12,F"I'm proud of myself but I'm also proud
OL,13,Fof my family because I wouldn't be
OL,14,Fwhere I am without them," she said.
